Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:10.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473,482)\fad(300,300)}Teng Eight\NTeng Family Core Member\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are willing to die for the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:19.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,even Teng One was defeated by Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we cannot win this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just have to delay him for one incense stick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:32.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill Wang Lin myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will obey your orders, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:01.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you surrender already ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:15.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,go to hell !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blazing Sky Nine Feathers !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the killer move of Teng Seven !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the rest of the Core Family Members
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,are here to deal with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay hidden,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:21.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:03.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Core Members are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone, return to the inner city !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor will be able to kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,He can't keep this up for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,This city has been here for hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Running away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:17.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(453,562)\fad(300,300)}Teng Bo\NTeng Family 9th generation\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you tolerate an intruder !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides, the Ancestor is still in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:26.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will act together to kill the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,All Teng Family Members,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,follow me in this bloody battle !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:33.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.59,0:05:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,The intruder
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be killed !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you a coward ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hold on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor will definitely come !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack together !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:37.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you remember
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,how you slaughtered my Wang Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,pay you back a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:53.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:53.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the souls of the Core Members ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:16.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:20.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are the gifts I specially prepared for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you come to have a look ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suppress evil, eliminate the Demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,connect to the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Divine Sword !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:36.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Formation artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:07:59.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,you let your family die
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to gain time for this attack ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see how long you can withstand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Divine Sword given to me by the Envoy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,with your Nascent Soul cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I killed you once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:33.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can kill you again !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A heaven defying
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation artifact...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in order to control it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,you had to put your Nascent Soul level Divine Sense inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is its weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:56.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,what a waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,How does it feel ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you killed my whole family,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,my heart also hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You killed my grandchild Teng Li
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I destroyed your whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Wang Family
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,deserved to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.04,Second,,0,0,0,,Nonsense !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the cultivation world, grudges should never involve mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan, you violated this rule
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:52.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I will have you watch with your own eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,the demise of the Teng Family you raised during hundreds of years !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, I will kill your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I will kill your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally destroy your Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:05.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, run away !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bo'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if we win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as the Ancestor is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:22.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Teng Family will come back to life !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:25.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior begs you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:26.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Futile resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Divine Sword cannot kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,the stalling was not for the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,but for the Reverse Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Teng Family cannot die
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I cannot die either !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reverse formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sacrifice the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sacrifice the family's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Invoke heavenly power !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 400 years
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:53.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,have been a huge gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:55.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I lose today
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be destroyed forever !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:17.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:18.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's crazy !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Daddy !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Daddy !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:30.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nooo !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bo'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:48.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not lose !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:06.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gathered everyone's cultivation in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to destroy you, Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:10.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will refine you for a thousand years
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:16.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have you pay for your crimes a hundredfold !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think your lightning artifact is specialized
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,in destroying Divine Sense of the same level.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,But today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have merged the cultivation of my whole family to the level of...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without your lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will restore the Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to its golden age !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get lost !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Futile resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,How long will you last ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Accept your death !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,poison ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remnants of the poison of a Soul Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it will not kill a Nascent Soul cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's enough to deal with the souls of low-level cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destroy !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,die !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:47.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:04.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:07.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:13.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:19.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:22.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:28.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:34.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:34.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:38.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:38.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:42.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:42.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:46.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:54.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:54.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:18:01.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:18:01.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:09.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:18.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:18.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:40.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:47.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:47.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:57.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:57.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:19:04.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:04.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
